<view class="page"><view class="hero">账户与连接</view><view class="sub">本地开发默认地址仅适用于开发者工具。手机预览须填写手机可访问的 HTTPS 服务地址。</view><label>API 地址（含 /api/v1）</label><input value="{{base}}" data-field="base" bindinput="input"/><label>账号</label><input value="{{account}}" data-field="account" bindinput="input"/><label>密码</label><input password value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input"/><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="submit">登录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="demo">连接开发演示账户</button><view class="sub small line">开发账户仅用于本机预览。无法连接时进入独立演示，演示记录不会自动上传。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="logout">退出并清空会话缓存（待核对记录按账号保留）</button></view>
